WEBVTT

01:40.729 --> 01:44.250
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.100 --> 01:47.160
[Episode 3]

01:47.670 --> 01:48.479
That's right.

01:51.150 --> 01:52.910
Hypocrisy, obsession,

01:53.070 --> 01:55.710
ignorance, jealousy, and cruelty.

01:56.229 --> 01:57.110
All the evils of the world

01:57.110 --> 01:58.580
stem from these sins.

01:58.630 --> 02:00.270
No one is free from their grasp.

02:01.750 --> 02:02.910
Not even you.

02:03.510 --> 02:05.230
Only by sealing away the divine artifacts,

02:05.990 --> 02:07.910
seeking the wisdom of the heavens through mortal flesh,

02:07.910 --> 02:09.150
and comprehending the Five Sins,

02:09.180 --> 02:11.970
can one glimpse the path to godhood.

02:23.950 --> 02:25.750
The foolish are stubborn.

02:26.230 --> 02:28.180
The ignorant are clouded at heart.

02:28.829 --> 02:30.870
Trapped in ignorance, their thoughts remain unclear.

02:30.910 --> 02:31.990
These are sins.

02:32.670 --> 02:34.030
Mortals may be ignorant,

02:34.030 --> 02:35.150
may be obsessed,

02:35.170 --> 02:36.610
may be jealous, hypocritical,

02:36.790 --> 02:37.910
even cruel.

02:38.270 --> 02:39.510
But gods may not.

02:40.350 --> 02:41.230
You may not.

02:41.870 --> 02:42.630
Gods may not.

02:42.630 --> 02:43.190
That's right, High Priest.

02:43.190 --> 02:43.950
You may not.

02:45.790 --> 02:46.550
High Priest,

02:46.550 --> 02:47.680
you can definitely become a god.

02:47.680 --> 02:48.790
We all believe in you.

02:49.510 --> 02:51.390
Yes.

02:53.670 --> 02:54.700
You must become a god.

02:55.270 --> 02:56.310
You must become a god.

02:56.460 --> 02:57.550
You must become a god.

02:58.180 --> 02:59.390
You must become a god.

02:59.390 --> 03:01.070
You can definitely become a god.

03:02.900 --> 03:03.990
Did he believe it?

03:04.840 --> 03:05.750
He believed it.

03:06.320 --> 03:07.870
He possessed great power,

03:08.150 --> 03:08.950
but in the end,

03:08.950 --> 03:10.190
he was merely a child.

03:10.750 --> 03:12.190
With voices whispering in his ears,

03:12.550 --> 03:13.830
how could he not believe it?

04:06.270 --> 04:08.320
Farewell, High Priest.

04:08.510 --> 04:10.710
Farewell, High Priest.

04:45.880 --> 04:47.409
The golden hoop sealed him away.

04:47.870 --> 04:49.360
For forty years, he remained imprisoned.

04:49.800 --> 04:50.790
I don't understand.

04:51.560 --> 04:53.030
He was your High Priest.

04:53.110 --> 04:53.990
He led you to victory

04:53.990 --> 04:55.180
against the War Demon.

04:55.210 --> 04:56.770
Why did you treat him that way?

04:56.940 --> 04:57.750
Because

04:59.190 --> 04:59.990
of fear.

05:01.030 --> 05:01.830
Fear?

05:02.470 --> 05:03.670
What are you afraid of?

05:03.950 --> 05:06.070
We killed his parents and loved ones.

05:11.070 --> 05:11.920
Long ago, our clan stumbled upon

05:11.920 --> 05:13.910
the Divine Left Hand.

05:14.120 --> 05:14.830
To find one who could wield it,

05:14.830 --> 05:16.590
we tested our young warriors

05:16.740 --> 05:19.790
one by one.

05:24.910 --> 05:26.590
But none could control its power.

05:27.610 --> 05:29.330
None.

05:31.990 --> 05:33.230
Their families,

05:33.230 --> 05:34.390
upon hearing the news,

05:34.430 --> 05:35.680
united in protest.

05:35.950 --> 05:37.880
They ascended Tianqu Peak,

05:38.320 --> 05:39.909
demanding their children be returned.

05:39.909 --> 05:40.830
Let my son go!

05:41.270 --> 05:42.070
Please, have mercy!

05:43.550 --> 05:44.510
Let my son go!

05:44.870 --> 05:46.110
I beg you, elders, have mercy!

05:46.220 --> 05:47.630
Let our sons go!

05:48.270 --> 05:49.860
Please, release my son, Yuanzhong!

05:50.060 --> 05:51.550
One spark

05:51.990 --> 05:53.150
and war ignited.

05:56.200 --> 05:58.510
Many perished that day.

06:01.670 --> 06:02.870
In desperation,

06:03.110 --> 06:04.790
we wove a lie.

06:05.630 --> 06:06.390
We told him his family

06:06.390 --> 06:07.920
had been slain by the War Demon.

06:08.590 --> 06:09.950
But wars ended.

06:10.070 --> 06:11.390
Lies unraveled.

06:11.990 --> 06:13.070
You feared him,

06:13.270 --> 06:14.500
so you wanted to destroy him.

06:14.710 --> 06:16.350
The War Demon was gone.

06:16.890 --> 06:18.420
The gods and demons were no more.

06:18.830 --> 06:20.030
Thus, the Divine Left Hand

06:20.030 --> 06:21.190
was no longer needed.

06:21.560 --> 06:22.690
It was no longer necessary.

06:28.670 --> 06:29.470
Oh no!

06:29.710 --> 06:31.310
The power is devouring me!

06:39.430 --> 06:40.190
I am not!

06:42.190 --> 06:42.990
I am not!

06:44.560 --> 06:45.350
I am not!

06:46.590 --> 06:47.470
I am not!

06:48.940 --> 06:49.870
I am not!

06:50.870 --> 06:51.510
I am not!

06:51.510 --> 06:52.390
You are.

06:53.310 --> 06:54.590
You crave admiration

06:54.590 --> 06:56.470
and bask in the illusion of heroism.

06:56.710 --> 06:58.180
Yet you have no power of your own.

06:58.220 --> 06:59.590
All of your strength

06:59.670 --> 07:01.510
comes from the Divine Left Hand.

07:01.510 --> 07:02.110
A power that was never yours

07:02.110 --> 07:03.480
to begin with.

07:03.790 --> 07:05.590
You relied on what was never yours,

07:05.630 --> 07:07.000
gaining the highest praise

07:07.000 --> 07:07.950
and glory.

07:08.350 --> 07:09.870
But tell me,

07:10.750 --> 07:12.110
does that not make you a hypocrite?

07:13.830 --> 07:15.110
No, I'm not!

07:15.110 --> 07:15.870
You are.

07:16.190 --> 07:17.470
You are stubborn,

07:17.470 --> 07:18.630
unyielding, and arrogant.

07:18.710 --> 07:20.030
Whenever the world defies your will,

07:20.110 --> 07:21.620
you glare and argue,

07:21.700 --> 07:23.460
bound by the chains of your own desire.

07:24.070 --> 07:25.750
Year by year, your ears grow deaf

07:25.750 --> 07:27.150
to voices beyond your own.

07:27.800 --> 07:29.150
You see yourself as the only one who is right,

07:29.150 --> 07:30.710
hold no one else in esteem,

07:30.710 --> 07:32.230
and trust no one but yourself.

07:32.790 --> 07:34.659
But do you truly know everything?

07:34.950 --> 07:35.870
Aren't you the one

07:36.030 --> 07:37.190
who's obsessed?

07:37.870 --> 07:39.630
Nonsense!

07:39.950 --> 07:41.000
Yet to you,

07:41.070 --> 07:42.470
isn't everyone else just talking nonsense?

07:42.740 --> 07:44.060
You left home young,

07:44.060 --> 07:45.380
spent years in the army,

07:45.550 --> 07:46.830
and never had much schooling.

07:46.950 --> 07:47.710
Naturally, you wouldn't understand

07:47.710 --> 07:49.430
the ways of the world.

07:50.070 --> 07:51.780
The foolish are stubborn.

07:51.830 --> 07:53.790
The ignorant are clouded at heart.

07:54.200 --> 07:55.550
You shut your eyes, deaf to the world,

07:55.550 --> 07:56.790
uneducated and unskilled,

07:56.870 --> 07:58.260
yet still complacent,

07:58.260 --> 08:00.150
thinking you're different from others.

08:00.550 --> 08:01.750
Isn't this stupid?

08:01.830 --> 08:03.190
Isn't this ignorant?

08:03.590 --> 08:05.710
And now you dream of becoming a god?

08:05.710 --> 08:06.430
No...

08:06.590 --> 08:07.390
No,

08:07.390 --> 08:08.150
I don't.

08:08.270 --> 08:09.260
I don't want to become a god.

08:09.260 --> 08:10.870
You don't want to become a god?

08:10.870 --> 08:12.430
Shut up!

08:12.670 --> 08:14.470
Are you seeking divinity for yourself?

08:14.490 --> 08:16.440
It was the Divine Left Hand that chose you,

08:16.510 --> 08:18.630
which means the Six Realms chose you.

08:18.630 --> 08:20.190
Upon your shoulders rests the fate

08:20.190 --> 08:21.750
of the Youhu Clan, the mortal realm,

08:21.750 --> 08:23.190
and the burden of the Six Realms.

08:23.670 --> 08:25.510
This world must have a god.

08:25.510 --> 08:27.030
You must become a god.

08:27.030 --> 08:28.430
If you choose to give up,

08:28.430 --> 08:30.110
it means you abandon the mortal world,

08:30.110 --> 08:31.190
abandon the Six Realms.

08:31.950 --> 08:33.870
How cruel of you.

08:33.870 --> 08:34.870
Don't listen to them.

08:35.110 --> 08:35.870
You just want to

08:35.870 --> 08:37.110
be an ordinary person.

08:37.630 --> 08:39.350
Who wouldn't want to be an ordinary person?

08:39.470 --> 08:40.630
Like Tanghua,

08:40.789 --> 08:42.150
loved by many,

08:42.190 --> 08:43.260
never criticized,

08:43.260 --> 08:44.470
never blamed.

08:44.600 --> 08:45.430
Unlike you,

08:45.830 --> 08:46.990
losing a hand,

08:47.100 --> 08:48.390
defeating the War Demon,

08:48.870 --> 08:49.790
yet still unable

08:49.790 --> 08:51.150
to meet their expectations.

08:51.380 --> 08:52.190
No.

08:52.260 --> 08:53.240
You're jealous of him, aren't you?

08:53.990 --> 08:55.030
Why does he get to live

08:55.030 --> 08:56.020
such a life

08:56.100 --> 08:57.190
while you cannot?

08:57.390 --> 08:58.310
You're jealous of him, aren't you?

08:58.510 --> 08:59.590
You're jealous of him, aren't you?

08:59.670 --> 09:00.470
No.

09:01.150 --> 09:01.950
No.

09:02.430 --> 09:03.270
I'm not.

09:04.430 --> 09:05.540
You must rid yourself of the Five Sins.

09:05.540 --> 09:07.350
You must transcend the sea of worldly desires.

09:07.390 --> 09:08.070
Yuanzhong!

09:08.070 --> 09:08.870
Obsession!

09:08.940 --> 09:10.750
Only by calming your mind can you walk out of here.

09:10.750 --> 09:12.590
Otherwise, you will be trapped here forever.

09:12.590 --> 09:15.110
Yuanzhong!

09:49.930 --> 09:50.740
Ji Tanyin.

09:59.760 --> 10:02.690
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

10:00.000 --> 10:01.120
Why are you here?

10:01.390 --> 10:02.830
I've long known that all living beings in this world

10:02.720 --> 10:06.090
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

10:02.830 --> 10:03.950
suffer in their own ways.

10:04.190 --> 10:05.150
Why aren't you speaking?

10:05.950 --> 10:06.750
But you...

10:06.850 --> 10:10.810
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

10:10.850 --> 10:14.180
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

10:14.940 --> 10:17.140
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

10:17.170 --> 10:19.370
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

10:19.600 --> 10:23.210
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

10:23.510 --> 10:25.710
♫If between oaths♫

10:25.990 --> 10:27.990
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

10:28.030 --> 10:31.760
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

10:32.380 --> 10:34.580
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

10:34.600 --> 10:36.770
♫Longing fades in half♫

10:36.980 --> 10:41.170
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

10:41.810 --> 10:48.960
♫A thousand years of long nights, yearning from dawn to dusk♫

10:54.710 --> 10:55.830
You embraced him.

10:58.310 --> 10:59.780
She embraced you. Why?

11:02.070 --> 11:02.910
I know.

11:03.090 --> 11:04.740
She probably admires you.

11:06.200 --> 11:07.430
I felt sorry for him.

11:10.390 --> 11:11.980
He was deceived by them.

11:11.980 --> 11:12.950
They told him that

11:12.950 --> 11:14.030
if he abandoned his desires

11:14.030 --> 11:14.870
and cast off the Five Sins,

11:14.870 --> 11:16.110
he could attain divinity.

11:16.110 --> 11:17.590
Wasn't that just a lie?

11:17.800 --> 11:18.710
Must gods truly be

11:18.750 --> 11:20.230
emotionless stones and tiles?

11:20.230 --> 11:21.630
Must they sever all ties and abandon love?

11:22.310 --> 11:23.070
Look,

11:23.070 --> 11:24.470
take you, Mr. Loong, for example.

11:24.660 --> 11:25.670
You're no different,

11:25.830 --> 11:27.390
greedy for food, fond of wine,

11:27.390 --> 11:28.750
cowardly, and lazy,

11:28.750 --> 11:30.150
yet you became a god.

11:30.230 --> 11:30.990
That just proves

11:30.990 --> 11:32.510
they were completely wrong.

11:32.510 --> 11:33.510
Just talk about him.

11:33.510 --> 11:34.550
Why bring me into this?

11:35.140 --> 11:36.430
What I mean is,

11:36.460 --> 11:38.180
Yuanzhong was deceived.

11:38.740 --> 11:40.470
Under the pretense of helping him cultivate,

11:40.470 --> 11:41.470
they sealed him away

11:41.590 --> 11:42.840
and imprisoned him atop Tianqu Peak

11:42.840 --> 11:44.310
forty years before they let him go.

11:44.710 --> 11:45.790
Those wicked deeds

11:45.870 --> 11:46.870
were most likely done by them

11:46.870 --> 11:48.420
in his name.

11:49.000 --> 11:50.070
So?

11:51.670 --> 11:53.510
So I think he is pitiful,

11:54.030 --> 11:56.230
and I couldn't help but embrace him

11:56.390 --> 11:57.470
to comfort him.

12:03.190 --> 12:03.990
Tanyin,

12:04.230 --> 12:05.540
I think there's something off

12:05.540 --> 12:06.830
about you.

12:08.150 --> 12:09.470
What's wrong with me?

12:09.550 --> 12:11.580
We've known each other for over a thousand years, haven't we?

12:12.430 --> 12:13.390
You are kind,

12:13.390 --> 12:16.030
but you are not someone who is overly emotional.

12:16.110 --> 12:17.270
Why is it that, this time in particular,

12:17.270 --> 12:18.510
you are so concerned

12:18.510 --> 12:19.590
about the High Priest of the Youhu Clan?

12:21.750 --> 12:23.230
I asked you to investigate her before.

12:23.590 --> 12:24.550
How did it go?

12:25.080 --> 12:26.710
Her identity and background are clear,

12:26.710 --> 12:27.750
nothing suspicious.

12:30.550 --> 12:32.030
Why are you looking at me like that?

12:32.650 --> 12:33.670
How did you investigate?

12:33.670 --> 12:34.750
I asked the human official

12:34.750 --> 12:36.070
who brought them here.

12:44.910 --> 12:45.860
Where are you going?

12:48.520 --> 12:50.640
I won't ask too much about your affairs.

12:51.270 --> 12:52.300
But, Tanyin,

12:52.710 --> 12:55.100
your descent to the mortal realm to search for the Divine Hand

12:55.150 --> 12:56.350
is known throughout the Divine Realm.

12:56.350 --> 12:57.470
Even the Preceptors of Discipline

12:57.470 --> 12:59.350
from the Thunder Division are already aware.

13:02.070 --> 13:03.350
Have you thought about it?

13:03.510 --> 13:05.140
What will happen

13:05.140 --> 13:07.310
if you fail to bring the Divine Left Hand

13:07.310 --> 13:08.430
back to the Heavenly Realm?

13:09.990 --> 13:12.670
Moreover, the Divine Left Hand

13:12.670 --> 13:15.070
is of great significance to the divine race.

13:15.390 --> 13:16.780
Even if, as you say,

13:16.780 --> 13:18.230
that High Priest of the Youhu Clan

13:18.230 --> 13:19.270
is a good person.

13:19.290 --> 13:20.850
Compared to Taihe

13:20.910 --> 13:22.080
and the Six Realms,

13:22.080 --> 13:23.350
which is more important?

13:24.670 --> 13:26.070
You can't compare them like that.

13:26.430 --> 13:28.430
Why can't I compare them like that?

13:28.510 --> 13:29.310
Ji Tanyin.

13:31.230 --> 13:32.110
He's calling me.

13:32.310 --> 13:33.310
I have to go now.

13:34.550 --> 13:35.980
I haven't finished speaking yet.

13:37.430 --> 13:38.230
Ji Tanyin.

13:42.390 --> 13:43.270
High Priest.

13:43.510 --> 13:44.310
Are you busy with something?

13:45.630 --> 13:46.510
Then come with me.

14:01.470 --> 14:02.310
High Priest,

14:02.650 --> 14:03.950
you wield the Divine Left Hand

14:03.950 --> 14:05.190
and bear a demigod's form.

14:05.320 --> 14:06.670
Illness should never touch you.

14:06.870 --> 14:08.750
Yet the golden hoop binds you,

14:09.020 --> 14:10.550
stripping your magical power

14:10.550 --> 14:12.190
and rendering you no different from a mortal,

14:12.190 --> 14:13.660
vulnerable to exhaustion and sickness.

14:14.270 --> 14:15.070
So?

14:15.090 --> 14:16.480
So you shouldn't put it on.

14:20.940 --> 14:22.130
-High Priest.
-High Priest.

14:26.140 --> 14:27.460
They fear you greatly.

14:27.630 --> 14:29.270
They say you are cruel,

14:29.270 --> 14:31.150
unpredictable, and volatile in temper.

14:31.390 --> 14:33.510
They say you live in extravagant indulgence,

14:33.510 --> 14:34.430
lost in endless debauchery.

14:34.430 --> 14:35.710
You are not only ruthless and lustful

14:35.710 --> 14:37.030
but also greedy and excessive.

14:37.190 --> 14:38.830
You drink a hundred jars of wine a day,

14:38.910 --> 14:39.670
and at the slightest displeasure,

14:39.670 --> 14:40.960
you take lives without hesitation.

14:41.670 --> 14:42.590
A hundred jars?

14:44.230 --> 14:45.670
That's quite a capacity.

14:46.780 --> 14:47.950
Aren't you angry?

14:49.150 --> 14:50.270
Why would I be angry?

14:50.630 --> 14:51.590
They misunderstand you.

14:51.590 --> 14:52.870
They even slander you.

14:53.790 --> 14:55.230
Greed, anger, delusion, arrogance, and doubt

14:56.190 --> 14:57.270
lead to misdeeds

14:57.420 --> 14:58.510
and hinder the cultivation.

14:58.790 --> 14:59.870
Seeking enlightenment and refining the heart

15:00.190 --> 15:01.630
has always been my lesson.

15:02.030 --> 15:03.020
What they say about me

15:03.430 --> 15:05.030
has nothing to do with me.

15:07.990 --> 15:09.470
Why do you care so much about me?

15:10.070 --> 15:10.950
Zi Fei said

15:11.230 --> 15:12.320
you admire me.

15:12.320 --> 15:13.110
Admire?

15:14.540 --> 15:15.380
Thinking about it carefully,

15:15.510 --> 15:16.990
it seems like from the very beginning,

15:17.410 --> 15:18.730
you knew who I was.

15:19.110 --> 15:20.830
That day, at the selection for handmaidens,

15:21.020 --> 15:22.270
when you saw me appear,

15:22.860 --> 15:24.350
you weren't surprised in the slightest.

15:25.740 --> 15:27.230
I've heard that many human women

15:27.230 --> 15:28.230
adore Tanghua,

15:28.750 --> 15:30.350
going to great lengths

15:30.990 --> 15:32.070
to enter his Jinxia Palace.

15:32.110 --> 15:32.950
I never thought

15:33.790 --> 15:35.150
I'd experience this myself.

15:35.740 --> 15:37.030
Don't overthink it.

15:37.030 --> 15:38.310
I'm not like them.

15:40.030 --> 15:40.830
Alright.

15:44.070 --> 15:45.150
You're leaving just like that?

15:46.830 --> 15:48.020
I haven't even finished speaking.

15:57.110 --> 15:57.900
Give it to me.

15:58.230 --> 15:59.500
I'll take it in for you.

15:59.500 --> 16:00.270
No need.

16:12.110 --> 16:12.840
Does he have to read

16:12.840 --> 16:13.950
so many books every day?

16:14.390 --> 16:15.670
It's part of his studies,

16:15.670 --> 16:16.950
which aids in his cultivation.

16:17.470 --> 16:18.630
Do you believe that too?

17:37.230 --> 17:38.030
You're here.

17:40.710 --> 17:42.060
I still have some things to write down.

17:42.350 --> 17:43.390
I'll speak with you later.

17:56.590 --> 17:57.710
You're from the immortal race.

17:58.110 --> 17:59.690
Does reading so many books help you?

17:59.790 --> 18:00.550
Of course.

18:01.120 --> 18:02.200
Books are like medicine.

18:02.510 --> 18:04.590
Reading them can dispel ignorance.

18:07.150 --> 18:08.590
So ignorance is a sin too.

18:08.780 --> 18:09.660
Is that so?

18:11.470 --> 18:12.390
That's exactly right.

18:12.670 --> 18:14.430
Ignorance is also a sin.

18:28.870 --> 18:29.670
Young Master,

18:31.600 --> 18:32.790
the Council of Elders has increased patrols

18:32.790 --> 18:34.150
in the clan,

18:34.550 --> 18:36.870
and the mountain's protective formation has been activated.

18:37.310 --> 18:40.030
Can they really deal with the War Demon

18:40.670 --> 18:42.150
with just those formations and guards?

18:42.340 --> 18:43.630
The Council of Elders believes they can.

18:45.440 --> 18:47.430
Young Master, look.

18:51.350 --> 18:52.920
How is the clan reacting now?

18:52.940 --> 18:54.770
They are in a state of panic, seeing danger in every shadow.

18:55.190 --> 18:56.230
The Council of Elders has urgently recalled

18:56.230 --> 18:57.830
all members from outside

18:57.980 --> 18:59.810
and is searching everywhere for traces of the War Demon.

19:00.350 --> 19:01.630
Anyone suspicious

19:01.630 --> 19:03.020
is to be captured first and questioned later.

19:03.020 --> 19:04.430
They've even dispatched people among humans

19:04.430 --> 19:05.510
to gather intelligence.

19:06.070 --> 19:06.870
In any case,

19:07.340 --> 19:08.630
they're already afraid.

19:11.150 --> 19:11.950
Are they?

19:13.110 --> 19:14.350
Good. That's enough.

19:27.590 --> 19:28.790
Where are you going?

19:29.540 --> 19:30.500
Today is the day to ascend Tianqu Peak

19:30.500 --> 19:31.630
for spirit refinement.

19:31.710 --> 19:32.510
Spirit refinement?

19:35.550 --> 19:36.550
This is a snack,

19:36.550 --> 19:38.180
freshly delivered from Xiaoxiang Peak.

19:39.500 --> 19:40.830
I'll have it when I return.

19:44.590 --> 19:45.870
Are you feeling unwell?

20:16.790 --> 20:18.550
So this is the Liujiao Palace.

20:19.150 --> 20:20.830
It's truly magnificent.

20:22.150 --> 20:22.950
Tanyin.

20:24.790 --> 20:26.070
Why are you here?

20:26.390 --> 20:27.710
I've joined Yaoxiang Peak

20:27.790 --> 20:29.790
and now follow Elder Xinyao.

20:30.590 --> 20:32.390
I came to deliver medicine to the High Priest.

20:34.150 --> 20:36.350
I heard the High Priest's in poor health

20:36.510 --> 20:37.470
and must take Elder Xinyao's refined pills

20:37.470 --> 20:39.200
every month.

20:40.230 --> 20:41.400
I never thought that

20:41.590 --> 20:43.160
even with a demigod's body,

20:43.270 --> 20:44.630
he could still fall ill.

20:45.830 --> 20:46.510
Oh, and inside,

20:46.510 --> 20:47.910
there's also a flask of medicinal wine.

20:47.910 --> 20:48.750
Elder Xinyao

20:48.750 --> 20:49.790
specifically instructed the High Priest

20:49.790 --> 20:51.230
to drink it before bed.

20:51.230 --> 20:52.380
It helps with sleep.

20:54.080 --> 20:55.160
Then I'll be going.

21:07.190 --> 21:08.360
You want to kill Yuanzhong?

21:09.960 --> 21:11.370
This poison may be potent,

21:11.940 --> 21:13.110
but it won't be enough to kill him.

21:19.590 --> 21:20.830
The Nailed Seven Arrows Curse

21:21.030 --> 21:21.950
is indeed a formidable

21:21.950 --> 21:23.030
cursing technique.

21:23.030 --> 21:23.830
But sadly,

21:24.210 --> 21:25.700
your method is flawed.

21:27.800 --> 21:29.290
So it was you who took it.

21:29.350 --> 21:30.190
If not for me,

21:30.190 --> 21:31.590
you would have been captured that day.

21:31.710 --> 21:32.680
What do you want?

21:32.710 --> 21:33.830
I don't want anything.

21:34.440 --> 21:35.230
But

21:35.790 --> 21:36.790
you cannot kill him.

21:36.790 --> 21:37.990
He is an evil spirit,

21:38.290 --> 21:40.000
cruel and bloodthirsty, enslaving entire races.

21:40.070 --> 21:40.780
Over the years,

21:40.780 --> 21:42.190
how many humans have died under the oppression

21:42.190 --> 21:43.150
of the Youhu Clan?

21:43.190 --> 21:44.540
They see themselves as gods,

21:44.540 --> 21:45.910
treating us like ants and livestock,

21:45.910 --> 21:46.820
to be crushed

21:46.820 --> 21:47.910
and slaughtered at will.

21:50.550 --> 21:51.470
This is a method I learned

21:51.470 --> 21:52.550
from ancient books.

21:53.410 --> 21:54.470
As long as I stay

21:54.470 --> 21:55.100
within 10 miles of my enemy,

21:55.100 --> 21:56.390
silently recite their name,

21:56.390 --> 21:57.110
bind grass into a human shape,

21:57.110 --> 21:58.070
and bow three times a day

21:58.070 --> 21:59.350
for 21 consecutive days,

21:59.430 --> 22:00.470
I can scatter their three souls

22:00.470 --> 22:01.480
and seven spirits.

22:01.670 --> 22:02.980
Then, I will have my revenge.

22:03.870 --> 22:04.950
I went through so much hardship

22:04.950 --> 22:05.910
just to get here.

22:05.930 --> 22:06.960
If not for you,

22:07.880 --> 22:09.200
I would have already succeeded.

22:09.270 --> 22:10.230
I told you,

22:10.470 --> 22:11.820
your steps are incomplete.

22:11.820 --> 22:12.990
Even if you bow until your back breaks,

22:12.990 --> 22:13.950
you won't succeed.

22:13.950 --> 22:14.670
And besides,

22:14.670 --> 22:15.710
he is not a bad person.

22:16.390 --> 22:17.950
What you speak of has nothing to do with him.

22:18.230 --> 22:19.030
He should not be

22:19.030 --> 22:20.190
the target of your hatred.

22:20.550 --> 22:21.670
I will say this one last time.

22:22.050 --> 22:23.110
If this happens again,

22:23.230 --> 22:24.510
I will not cover for you.

22:25.070 --> 22:25.870
Now leave.

22:27.950 --> 22:29.350
You're human too.

22:30.390 --> 22:32.030
Why are you defending our enemy?

22:32.990 --> 22:34.070
Is he really an enemy?

22:34.100 --> 22:34.740
Yes.

22:35.430 --> 22:37.150
He is the High Priest of the Youhu Clan.

22:37.350 --> 22:38.430
He possesses the Divine Left Hand,

22:38.430 --> 22:39.550
wielding a force vast enough

22:39.550 --> 22:41.000
to upheave the heavens and shatter the earth.

22:41.110 --> 22:42.910
Why do you insist on protecting him?

22:43.780 --> 22:45.400
Should someone be condemned simply for having power?

23:02.790 --> 23:03.630
What's wrong with him?

23:04.280 --> 23:05.080
It's nothing.

23:17.710 --> 23:18.670
Madam Zhi Dai.

23:23.910 --> 23:24.790
It's so late.

23:24.870 --> 23:25.790
Where have you been?

23:26.470 --> 23:28.030
I was sent by Elder Xinyao

23:28.030 --> 23:29.500
to deliver medicine to the Liujiao Palace.

23:31.110 --> 23:32.750
Madam Zhi Dai, I have things to do.

23:32.770 --> 23:33.720
I'll take my leave.

24:02.670 --> 24:03.750
What's really going on with him?

24:04.630 --> 24:05.630
He's still not doing well.

24:06.470 --> 24:07.230
Stay here and watch over him.

24:07.230 --> 24:07.870
I'll go to Yaoxiang Peak

24:07.870 --> 24:09.070
to invite Elder Xinyao over.

24:12.110 --> 24:12.910
High Priest.

24:20.470 --> 24:21.590
Why is your body so cold?

24:23.070 --> 24:24.270
Are you ill?

24:26.770 --> 24:28.050
It's my studies.

24:29.150 --> 24:30.630
Is this part of your cultivation too?

24:34.550 --> 24:35.350
High Priest!

24:36.350 --> 24:37.150
High Priest.

24:39.350 --> 24:40.190
High Priest.

24:54.240 --> 24:55.030
Here she comes.

25:06.910 --> 25:09.070
He's lost too much blood, and his pulse is weak.

25:09.370 --> 25:11.050
The Divine Left Hand is saving him now.

25:11.790 --> 25:12.470
Elder Dingxu has changed

25:12.470 --> 25:13.550
the spirit refinement sessions from once every ten days

25:13.550 --> 25:14.670
to once every five days.

25:14.670 --> 25:15.710
That's too much for his body to endure.

25:15.710 --> 25:16.240
Why didn't you

25:16.240 --> 25:17.510
tell me earlier?

25:17.750 --> 25:18.540
Yuanzhong said

25:18.710 --> 25:19.910
it aids his cultivation

25:19.910 --> 25:20.880
and forbade me from informing you.

25:20.990 --> 25:21.790
You people...

25:38.110 --> 25:39.430
Quick, help him out of the medicinal bath.

25:39.550 --> 25:40.910
The potency of the medicine is too strong.

25:40.910 --> 25:41.830
His body is too weak

25:41.830 --> 25:42.710
to endure it.

25:44.030 --> 25:44.830
Go on ahead.

25:44.830 --> 25:45.950
Boil some more hot water in the kitchen.

26:09.200 --> 26:13.600
[Liujiao Palace]

26:22.170 --> 26:23.250
Is he feeling better?

26:23.470 --> 26:24.550
What are you doing here?

26:24.550 --> 26:25.510
Elder Xinyao is inside.

26:25.510 --> 26:26.510
He'll be fine.

26:28.470 --> 26:29.630
What is spirit refinement?

26:30.070 --> 26:31.190
It is part of his studies.

26:31.950 --> 26:33.190
It is a secret technique of our clan.

26:33.190 --> 26:34.070
I cannot tell you.

26:34.910 --> 26:36.390
You don't have to keep watch here the whole time.

26:57.180 --> 26:58.940
Dingxu has changed the spirit refinement schedule.

26:59.830 --> 27:01.470
Why didn't you tell me?

27:02.430 --> 27:04.230
Well, now you know, don't you?

27:06.950 --> 27:08.230
Do you really think

27:08.780 --> 27:10.230
this training is useful to you?

27:12.950 --> 27:13.750
Yes.

27:15.230 --> 27:16.750
And it is of great use.

27:17.900 --> 27:19.100
Humans have five sins:

27:20.220 --> 27:21.100
cruelty,

27:21.670 --> 27:22.550
obsession,

27:23.710 --> 27:24.510
hypocrisy,

27:25.230 --> 27:26.030
jealousy,

27:26.990 --> 27:27.790
and ignorance.

27:28.470 --> 27:30.310
Only through diligent cultivation,

27:31.000 --> 27:32.280
aligning knowledge with action,

27:33.000 --> 27:34.710
can one rid themselves of the Five Sins

27:35.670 --> 27:37.060
and attain divinity.

27:38.260 --> 27:40.270
My talent and insight

27:40.710 --> 27:42.110
are quite remarkable.

27:43.830 --> 27:45.510
And with the Divine Left Hand,

27:47.110 --> 27:48.110
I believe

27:49.130 --> 27:50.990
I will eventually find a way

27:51.840 --> 27:53.400
to comprehend the Great Way.

27:54.900 --> 27:55.700
You...

27:55.720 --> 27:57.330
Elder Xinyao, don't worry.

27:58.670 --> 28:00.550
These are all necessary steps.

28:02.190 --> 28:03.230
I can handle it.

28:07.550 --> 28:08.990
Then you should rest well.

28:09.560 --> 28:10.600
I'll be going now.

28:11.630 --> 28:12.750
Take care, Elder.

28:37.480 --> 28:39.150
High Priest, are you hungry?

28:41.270 --> 28:42.110
A little.

28:42.470 --> 28:43.430
What would you like to eat?

28:47.220 --> 28:48.430
Red Oil Cloud Strings.

28:49.820 --> 28:50.660
W-What?

28:52.710 --> 28:55.990
It's when you soak the cloud strings in water,

28:56.910 --> 28:58.550
drain them after a while,

28:59.390 --> 29:01.110
then cut red peppers into thin strips,

29:02.030 --> 29:05.630
add salt, sugar, and other seasonings,

29:06.390 --> 29:08.950
pour hot oil over it, and stir well.

29:10.270 --> 29:11.550
What are cloud strings?

29:16.110 --> 29:17.640
What about Kidney Bean Immortal Soup?

29:20.260 --> 29:21.270
Grain Rain Tofu?

29:24.700 --> 29:25.700
Never mind then.

29:28.110 --> 29:28.900
Porridge?

29:30.030 --> 29:30.910
Is porridge okay?

29:33.550 --> 29:34.340
Sure.

29:34.710 --> 29:35.750
Wait for me a moment.

29:44.750 --> 29:45.550
High Priest,

29:45.780 --> 29:46.900
have you ever thought

29:46.950 --> 29:48.590
that everything they told you might be a lie?

29:58.630 --> 29:59.410
Doubt

30:00.590 --> 30:02.070
is also a form of obsession.

30:03.440 --> 30:04.730
Obsession is a sin.

30:29.070 --> 30:31.190
How have you been settling in at the Liujiao Palace?

30:32.270 --> 30:33.070
It's been good.

30:34.190 --> 30:35.190
What about the High Priest?

30:35.510 --> 30:36.550
How does he treat you?

30:37.590 --> 30:38.430
Not bad.

30:41.790 --> 30:43.070
Did you come to see me today

30:43.390 --> 30:44.350
because of something?

30:46.790 --> 30:47.750
There is indeed something.

30:48.310 --> 30:49.230
Do you remember

30:49.430 --> 30:50.950
someone was performing curses

30:50.950 --> 30:52.190
at Xiaoxiang Peak before?

30:52.510 --> 30:54.110
I even searched your room back then.

30:54.830 --> 30:56.270
At that moment, I found nothing.

30:56.750 --> 30:57.670
But yesterday,

30:57.740 --> 30:59.340
I ran into Lyu Yao on the road.

30:59.870 --> 31:01.950
She looked panicked and terrified.

31:02.300 --> 31:03.590
So I followed her.

31:04.390 --> 31:06.230
Guess what I found?

31:10.060 --> 31:10.870
She said

31:11.410 --> 31:13.210
it was you covering for her.

31:18.030 --> 31:19.030
Over the years,

31:19.510 --> 31:21.070
we have had frequent clashes

31:21.070 --> 31:22.110
with the Youhu Clan.

31:22.910 --> 31:24.670
The Youhu people pride themselves on their status,

31:24.800 --> 31:26.290
claiming to be saviors.

31:26.790 --> 31:27.780
Our people

31:27.780 --> 31:29.290
no longer wish to continue serving them.

31:30.150 --> 31:31.510
Some of the more radical members

31:31.510 --> 31:32.830
have made it their goal to take down the Youhu Clan

31:32.930 --> 31:34.570
and kill the High Priest.

31:35.110 --> 31:36.310
It's not the first time

31:36.310 --> 31:37.590
they've sent assassins up the mountain.

31:37.920 --> 31:38.740
Clearly,

31:38.920 --> 31:40.310
Lyu Yao is one of those people.

31:41.070 --> 31:42.430
But what I'm curious about is,

31:42.910 --> 31:44.600
who are you?

31:53.850 --> 31:54.930
I've investigated you.

31:55.430 --> 31:56.510
Your background is clean,

31:56.510 --> 31:57.620
and your family is well-regarded.

31:57.910 --> 31:59.070
You seem like

31:59.070 --> 32:00.630
a well-mannered young lady

32:00.630 --> 32:01.750
who doesn't go out much.

32:02.590 --> 32:03.390
But,

32:04.350 --> 32:06.370
who taught you your craftsmanship?

32:07.190 --> 32:08.870
In our human race, craftsmanship is highly esteemed.

32:08.980 --> 32:10.860
Each province and county has a craft school,

32:11.590 --> 32:13.680
and all craftsmen must be registered.

32:14.310 --> 32:15.510
You never attended school,

32:15.590 --> 32:16.790
nor did you apprentice.

32:17.640 --> 32:18.430
So, where did

32:18.430 --> 32:19.990
your extraordinary craftsmanship

32:19.990 --> 32:21.270
come from?

32:29.060 --> 32:30.070
Why are you smiling?

32:31.360 --> 32:32.410
Madam Zhi Dai,

32:33.230 --> 32:34.830
do you have a favor to ask of me?

32:38.340 --> 32:39.750
If you're just suspicious of me,

32:40.060 --> 32:41.350
you have Lyu Yao in your hands.

32:41.370 --> 32:42.480
You could just expose me.

32:43.080 --> 32:44.840
Why bother coming here to interrogate me?

32:55.570 --> 32:56.750
What do you want?

32:56.950 --> 32:58.190
Why don't you just say it?

32:58.750 --> 32:59.950
Perhaps I can help.

33:00.830 --> 33:01.550
But if you

33:01.550 --> 33:02.830
keep beating around the bush,

33:03.190 --> 33:04.510
I'll lose interest in listening.

33:06.750 --> 33:07.920
I want to ask for your help

33:08.650 --> 33:10.580
to unlock this Two-Form Immobilizing Bracelet.

33:19.780 --> 33:20.590
You're awake.

33:23.990 --> 33:25.590
Are you going to Tianqu Peak again?

33:28.430 --> 33:29.430
Don't go.

33:29.510 --> 33:31.070
You still look weak.

33:31.460 --> 33:32.590
I'm much better now.

33:33.930 --> 33:35.040
Is it a must?

33:37.150 --> 33:38.070
Yes, it is.

33:40.270 --> 33:41.230
Then I'll go with you.

33:50.430 --> 33:51.580
I was right.

33:52.300 --> 33:53.620
She really has taken a liking to you.

34:11.550 --> 34:13.230
Sit up here, and I'll push you.

34:13.790 --> 34:14.750
Lying down for a few days

34:15.110 --> 34:16.219
has left my bones all stiff.

34:20.860 --> 34:22.170
How does the spirit refinement at Tianqu Peak

34:22.429 --> 34:23.550
differ from

34:23.550 --> 34:24.699
your usual practice?

34:25.739 --> 34:28.170
Spirit refinement tests my willpower.

34:29.639 --> 34:30.510
Is it difficult?

34:32.150 --> 34:32.989
It's manageable.

34:34.070 --> 34:34.710
But that day,

34:34.710 --> 34:35.989
you were already unconscious

34:36.070 --> 34:37.590
and lay in the room for three days.

34:37.920 --> 34:39.070
It's part of the test;

34:39.710 --> 34:41.070
hardships are inevitable.

34:43.830 --> 34:44.630
By the way,

34:45.219 --> 34:46.510
when you came to Fangwai Mountain,

34:46.790 --> 34:47.870
did you pass through Baisha Bay

34:48.350 --> 34:49.750
and try the pricky fruit there?

34:50.429 --> 34:51.469
What is that?

34:51.830 --> 34:53.150
It's black in color,

34:53.489 --> 34:54.810
only about the size of a fingernail.

34:55.350 --> 34:56.400
It's sour and astringent at first,

34:56.630 --> 34:57.590
but it has a sweet aftertaste.

34:57.990 --> 34:58.940
It's really tasty.

35:03.270 --> 35:04.630
What a shame, then.

35:10.990 --> 35:11.920
High Priest,

35:14.590 --> 35:16.110
you're late today.

35:16.790 --> 35:17.710
I overslept.

35:17.950 --> 35:19.370
Spirit refinement is crucial.

35:19.410 --> 35:20.850
Elder Dingxu once emphasized

35:21.000 --> 35:22.370
the importance of being punctual.

35:27.760 --> 35:28.750
Wait for me here.

35:29.340 --> 35:30.750
Can't I go in with you?

35:39.930 --> 35:42.690
[No Trespassing] [Offenders Will Be Punished]

36:42.980 --> 36:44.670
Please wait here, High Priest.

36:44.750 --> 36:46.430
I'll go notify Elder Dingxu.

36:58.950 --> 36:59.780
Let me out!

36:59.830 --> 37:00.660
Let me out!

37:00.790 --> 37:01.780
Let me out!

37:02.160 --> 37:03.600
Let me out!

37:04.870 --> 37:06.430
Let me out!

37:45.950 --> 37:46.750
High Priest,

37:49.070 --> 37:49.870
sorry to keep you waiting.

37:51.390 --> 37:52.190
What's wrong?

38:09.070 --> 38:10.390
How's your rest been

38:10.750 --> 38:11.870
these past few days?

38:13.910 --> 38:14.710
It's been good.

38:15.070 --> 38:16.670
I heard that after you went back last time,

38:16.670 --> 38:17.380
Elder Xinyao

38:17.380 --> 38:18.870
went to the Liujiao Palace overnight.

38:19.630 --> 38:21.230
Is there something wrong with your body?

38:22.070 --> 38:23.710
You don't look well.

38:24.150 --> 38:26.070
Do you need to rest for a few more days?

38:27.550 --> 38:28.620
To refine the spirit and grasp the path to enlightenment,

38:29.310 --> 38:32.070
every fleeting day of delay is a loss to me.

38:35.790 --> 38:37.300
Congratulations, High Priest.

38:37.550 --> 38:38.500
It seems like your enlightenment

38:38.540 --> 38:40.170
has deepened again.

38:41.910 --> 38:42.700
Let's begin.

38:43.270 --> 38:44.070
Yes.

39:05.510 --> 39:06.510
How is it now?

39:08.190 --> 39:09.110
Does it hurt a lot?

39:20.870 --> 39:22.140
It's already noon.

39:22.140 --> 39:23.760
When will he come out?

39:24.580 --> 39:25.750
Once the spirit refinement is finished,

39:26.070 --> 39:27.230
he'll naturally come out.

39:27.910 --> 39:29.550
Then when will it end?

39:32.150 --> 39:33.270
It's hard to say.

39:35.860 --> 39:37.430
It could be two or three hours,

39:37.580 --> 39:40.060
but it could also take a whole day and night.

39:40.190 --> 39:41.870
How many tests does he have to go through

39:41.870 --> 39:43.150
before he can complete the spirit refinement?

39:46.150 --> 39:47.670
His body is still very weak.

39:47.790 --> 39:49.190
I'm afraid he won't last long.

39:49.710 --> 39:51.230
Can it end earlier?

40:26.150 --> 40:27.510
Master, it's enough.

40:34.910 --> 40:37.350
Let's stop here for today.

40:52.470 --> 40:54.310
Can't believe the Essence Nourishing Pill is actually...
